LPL alien description

  specification description

    part Vars	of sort list[identifier]
	 	import sigSyntax
    part Ops1   of sort list[pair[identifier,int]]
                import sigSyntax
    part Ops2   of sort list[pair[identifier,int]]
                import sigSyntax
     
  end

  query 	of sort combiSystem
         	result of sort combiSystem
	 	import alien[Vars,Ops1,Ops2] bool eqSystem combiSystem
			
         	start with (purifystrat) query 

end

